Full text: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Portions of this data (building names, centroids, and footprint geometry)
are derived from OpenStreetMap and are therefore a Derivative Database
under the ODbL. Records carrying `location.source = "osm"` are OSM-derived.

